000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. FIGLIT.
000300* Nucleus level 2 in the scanner: HIGH-VALUES, LOW-VALUES, QUOTES
000400* and ALL literal as a MOVE source and in a condition; ZEROES; and
000500* the continuation of a word and of a numeric literal across lines.
000600* QUOTE is the apostrophe here and the double quote in GnuCOBOL, so
000700* it is tested against itself rather than displayed.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001000 01  X            PIC X(7) VALUE 'ABCDEFG'.
001100 01  Y            PIC X(3) VALUE 'XYZ'.
001200 01  Q            PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
001300 01  N            PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZEROES.
001350 01  E-N          PIC 9(5).99.
001360 01  Y4           PIC X(4).
001400 01  LONG-DATA-NAME-ONE PIC 9(5) VALUE 12345.
001500 01  T.
001600     05  E OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC X(4).
001700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001800 MAIN.
001900     MOVE ALL 'AB' TO X.
002000     DISPLAY '[' X ']'.
002100     IF X = ALL 'AB' DISPLAY 'X IS ALL AB'.
002200     MOVE ALL '-' TO Y.
002300     DISPLAY '[' Y ']'.
002400     MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO X.
002500     IF X = HIGH-VALUES DISPLAY 'X IS HIGH'.
002600     IF X NOT = LOW-VALUES DISPLAY 'X IS NOT LOW'.
002700     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO Y.
002800     IF Y = LOW-VALUES DISPLAY 'Y IS LOW'.
002900     IF Y < HIGH-VALUES DISPLAY 'LOW BELOW HIGH'.
003000     MOVE QUOTES TO Q.
003100     IF Q = QUOTES DISPLAY 'Q IS QUOTES'.
003200     IF Q NOT = SPACES DISPLAY 'Q IS NOT SPACES'.
003300     MOVE ALL 'XYZ' TO E (2).
003400     MOVE E (2) TO Y4. DISPLAY '[' Y4 ']'.
003500     MOVE LONG-DATA-NA
003600-        ME-ONE TO N.
003700     ADD 123
003800-        45.5 TO N.
003900     MOVE N TO E-N. DISPLAY E-N.
004000     MOVE ZEROES TO N.
004100     MOVE N TO E-N. DISPLAY E-N.
004200     STOP RUN.
